; Area K: 1000 file operations (create, note, rename, read, delete).
FailAt 21
Delete NC1:ops ALL QUIET
MakeDir NC1:ops
Avail FLUSH
Set n 0
Lab loop
Echo "file $n" >NC1:ops/f$n
FileNote NC1:ops/f$n "note $n" QUIET
Rename NC1:ops/f$n NC1:ops/g$n QUIET
Type NC1:ops/g$n >NIL:
Delete NC1:ops/g$n QUIET
Set n `Eval $n + 1`
If $n LT 200
  Skip loop BACK
EndIf
Echo "== ops done: $n x 5"
List NC1:ops
Delete NC1:ops QUIET
Avail FLUSH
